      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Rollback handles are IMMUTABLE tags: vX.Y.Z rolls ALL services back atomically; sha-<git> rolls one service. Never roll back to latest.\nLocal: IMAGE_TAG=v1.2.3 ./deploy-all.sh uat --only \u2026 -y   \u00b7   GitHub: Actions \u2192 Run workflow (env, image_tag, services). Ledger never fails a deploy.",
      "originalText": "Rollback handles are IMMUTABLE tags: vX.Y.Z rolls ALL services back atomically; sha-<git> rolls one service. Never roll back to latest.\nLocal: IMAGE_TAG=v1.2.3 ./deploy-all.sh uat --only \u2026 -y   \u00b7   GitHub: Actions \u2192 Run workflow (env, image_tag, services). Ledger never fails a deploy.",
